ol\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"develop\\\",\\\"ability\\\":null,\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Related capabilities were searched. probe covers small-material tests but its retrieved summary does not establish piece-geometry observation or container-prerequisite assessment. source-bound-joining-trial measures and loosely wraps Lin's specific vine and branches; its source bindings, inputs and effects do not cover Sol's birch. The food and opened-specimen assessments provide reusable evidence-reporting machinery, not an equivalent birch assessment. Develop the smallest nondestructive, source-bound feasibility assessment through the existing current-conversation handoff. Missing geometry must remain unavailable, not become fabricated sheet geometry or grounds for permanent rejection.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Implement Assess(specimenId=item-66-sol-388,evidenceRefs=[]) for Sol's actual owned, unreserved birch stack: quantity 0.8, quantityTenths 8, origin forest-birch-2, harvestedAt 66. Require live identity, ownership, local physical access and sufficient energy; carried inventory is accessible without treating its stored coordinate as a remote worksite. No substitute material, automatic gathering, tool, support, adhesive, cord, water, heat or other participant is supplied. Validate before charging. Execution is one atomic active round costing 0.5 energy, with zero destructive sample, zero consumed material and zero recovery work. The sole physical method is gentle exterior viewing/reorientation within existing nondamaging handling; no pressing, bending, folding, cutting, joining, loading, food contact or fabrication is authorized.\\\\nReuse and record the actual code dependencies: source-bound-joining-trial's source reconciliation and bounded geometry-reporting utilities where applicable, and bounded-unfamiliar-food-assessment's private dated evidence/uncertainty report machinery. Inspect their full implementation facts in the development handoff before integration; do not claim