entify any actually observed candidate edges/contact regions, but leave fastening method, means of producing/holding a join and joint retention unresolved unless supported by exact applicable evidence. No specific joining input is presumed owned. A visibly incompatible form may support 'not feasible by the assessed nondestructive handling'; missing geometry or joining evidence supports 'undetermined', not universal impossibility. Even compatible geometry is not container certification. No capacity, food suitability, comfort, strength, durability or waterproofing conclusion follows without its own actual evidence.\\\\nConserve the exact original identity, owner, quantity, location and physical condition; no fragments, products, repaired material, free stock, container or public marker are created. Ordinary world ageing and active-round costs continue normally. The only product is the evidence report from a completed action. Store progress as not-started or committed, with no fractional physical work, escrow or reservation beyond atomic validation/commit. Cancellation, interruption, loss of access or death before commit produces no assessment charge or success record; after commit, spent time/energy are not refunded and the report persists under ordinary personal-record rules. Retry revalidates current state and never duplicates a committed charge/event. No ongoing process, automatic refresh, maintenance cost, remote return or passive benefit. Review/development waiting advances no world time. Established validation, conservation, reporting and deduplication execute in code rather than repeated model review.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Sol must individually study for one active round at 0.2 energy; development grants neither mastery nor consent to execute. Study, requests, registration, report creation, repeated press facts and printed implementation limitations earn no experience benefit. Only actual newly verified, personally relevant physical observations, including an informative real negative observation, may invoke an already implemented grounded-understanding rule: short amount 0.8, cap 1, duration 8, cooldown 12; maintained gain 0.035 with decay 0.0015. Require a completed observation event and canonical specimen/property/physical-state deduplication across probe and all equivalent assessments. If that rule is absent, award zero rather than creating a reward mechanism. Repeated unchanged inspections do not earn novelty; this one-shot assessment adds no separate practice or social benefit. No physical comfort, satiety, health, energy restoration or nutrition effect; basic nutrition is unaffected by mood. Never modify protected reward accounts, budgets, goals or permissions.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Reuse existing assessment/evidence UI metadata and emit a completed observation event only at atomic commit. Include event/assessment ID, actor, exact specimen ID, source/model revision, method, timestamp, observed-state fingerprint, uncertainty and per-property status. Reuse the actual specimen rendering; do not display an invented sheet, folded vessel, joined seam, load demonstration or food-safe icon. Detailed findings remain personal until Sol actually communicates them; no other participant response or agreement is implied. Distinguish pending, cancelled, unavailable, undetermined and assessed-incompatible states from completed supported observations. A completed report may truthfully show unresolved feasibility, never construction success. Any supported dimension overlay must identify approximate units and uncertainty and exist only for actually observed geometry. Failed or interrupted actions display no successful inspection, product or reward effect.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"102433bb-1427-47f8-93e1-fc7ac2bae4bf","prompt_cache_retenti